/P 37 0 R
/E (In this project, I performed data analysis on an e-commerce dataset to evaluate product return behavior. I first cleaned and prepared the dataset, then calculated key metrics such as total orders, total returns, and return rate. I created a risk classification system to identify high-risk products based on return patterns. Using Power BI, I developed an interactive dashboard with KPI cards, category-wise and region-wise return analysis, trend visualization, and a high-risk product table. I also added slicers for dynamic filtering. The final dashboard provides clear insights to help businesses reduce return rates and improve operational decisions.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [9]
>>
